{#
| Variable               | Type    | Description                                              |
|------------------------|---------|----------------------------------------------------------|
| component              | object  | merchant settings from twilight.json                     |
| component.title        | string  | the package's name                                       |
| component.tagline      | string  | the line under it                                        |
| component.count        | string  | the big number (empty → no count line)                   |
| component.count_label  | string  | the words beside that number                             |
| component.image        | string  | the wide photo                                           |
| component.items        | array   | what is inside, in order (up to 6)                       |
| item.image             | string  | the tile's photo                                         |
| item.qty               | string  | how many — «32 عبوة»                                     |
| item.name              | string  | what it is                                               |
| product                | ?object | the page's product, when Salla hands it to the block     |

Package contents — Figma "Qusah Re-Vamp": desktop 113:35929, mobile 290:10113.
A product-page block; everything it shows is typed and uploaded here, and
nothing in it is a link. Which package it belongs to is Salla's choice, not a
setting: in the theme editor the merchant opens «صفحة تفاصيل المنتج», picks
«تخصيص منتج محدد» and the package, and adds this block — Salla prints it on
that product's page only. pages/product/single.twig gives the «before reviews»
slot the description's place, and js/product.js lays the page out as a package
when one of these is on it. Styles: 04-components/qissa-product-detail.scss.

Off a product page (the home page) it is printed hidden and nothing shows it;
product.js shows it where Salla did not hand the block the page's product.
#}
{% if component.title or component.image or component.items|length %}
    <section class="qpd-pack" data-qpd-pack{{ product is defined and product and product.id ? '' : ' hidden' }}>
        {% if component.title %}
            <p class="qpd-pack__name">{{ component.title }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        <p class="qpd-pack__tag">{{ component.tagline|default(trans('blocks.qissa.pack_tagline')) }}</p>

        {% if component.count %}
            <p class="qpd-pack__count"><b>{{ component.count }}</b> <span>{{ component.count_label }}</span></p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if component.image %}
            <img class="qpd-pack__img" src="{{ component.image }}" alt="{{ component.title }}" loading="lazy"/>
        {% endif %}

        {% if component.items|length %}
            <div class="qpd-pack__tiles">
                {% for item in component.items|slice(0, 6) %}
                    <div class="qpd-pack__tile">
                        {% if item.image %}<img src="{{ item.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy"/>{% endif %}
                        {% if item.qty %}<b>{{ item.qty }}</b>{% endif %}
                        {% if item.name %}<span>{{ item.name }}</span>{% endif %}
                    </div>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        {% endif %}
    </section>
{% endif %}
